%% ADR-202 / W-B2 — Audio player logout cleanup contract
%% Founder decision: limpa SOMENTE audio.resume.v1 + OAuth tokens
%% Persiste: audio.queue.v1 + audio.onboarding.seen.v1

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Logout Button<br/>OR 401 Handler
    participant Hook as useLogout / auth flow
    participant Cleanup as clearAudioOnLogout()<br/>(logoutCleanup.ts)
    participant ResumeMod as resumeSession.ts
    participant SpotDriver as SpotifyDriver
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant API as POST /api/auth/logout

    User->>UI: Click logout<br/>OR refresh token expira (401)
    UI->>Hook: logout()

    Hook->>Cleanup: clearAudioOnLogout()

    Note over Cleanup: ADR-202 — escopo restrito por design

    Cleanup->>ResumeMod: clearResumeSnapshot()
    ResumeMod->>LS: removeItem('audio.resume.v1')
    LS-->>ResumeMod: ok
    ResumeMod-->>Cleanup: ok

    Note over Cleanup,LS: NAO chama clearQueue()<br/>NAO chama clearOnboardingSeen()<br/>(decisao founder MP3.2)

    Cleanup->>SpotDriver: disconnect()<br/>(se conectado)
    SpotDriver->>LS: removeItem('audio.spotify.oauth.snapshot.v1')
    SpotDriver->>API: POST /api/audio/spotify/disconnect<br/>(server-side token revoke)
    API-->>SpotDriver: ok
    SpotDriver-->>Cleanup: ok

    Cleanup-->>Hook: void (idempotente)

    Hook->>API: POST /api/auth/logout
    API-->>Hook: 200 OK<br/>+ clear cookies
    Hook->>UI: redirect /login

    Note over LS: Estado final localStorage:<br/>- audio.resume.v1 → REMOVIDO<br/>- audio.spotify.oauth.snapshot.v1 → REMOVIDO<br/>- audio.queue.v1 → PERSISTE (lessonIds publicos)<br/>- audio.onboarding.seen.v1 → PERSISTE (UX device-scope)

    User->>UI: Re-login (futuro)
    UI->>UI: Mount AudioPlayerProvider
    UI->>LS: getItem('audio.queue.v1')
    LS-->>UI: { lessonIds: [...] }
    UI->>UI: Hidrata queue restaurada ✓
    UI->>LS: getItem('audio.onboarding.seen.v1')
    LS-->>UI: { seen: true }
    UI->>UI: NAO mostra tooltip (UX preserved) ✓
    UI->>LS: getItem('audio.resume.v1')
    LS-->>UI: null
    UI->>UI: Sem resume snapshot (clean state) ✓
